 Since $x^5 + 7 = x^5 + 5x^2 + 6 + (5x^2 + 1)$, we have \begin{align*}
(x^5 + 7) &= (x + 1)(x^4 - x^3 + x^2 - x + 1) + 6, 
\end{align*}the remainder is $6.$</think> <answer> $6$</answer>

